## Phase 1 — keymap table parity for the diff layer
- table.rs: the 5 v1-era residue bindings fixed to v2 semantics —
  diff.toggle/expand/expand_all/collapse/switch_focus default "none"
  (keybind.ts:75-79 "deprecated: file tree is mouse-controlled").
- Added the missing v2 scroll family: diff.down j,down / diff.up k,up /
  diff.page.down pagedown,ctrl+f / diff.page.up pageup,ctrl+b /
  diff.half_page.down ctrl+d / diff.half_page.up ctrl+u /
  diff.first gg,home / diff.last shift+g,end / diff.mark_reviewed m.
- diff.next_file n,alt+down / diff.previous_file p,alt+up /
  diff.help ?,shift+?,shift+/ (was n / p / ?).
- diff-layer app.exit ctrl+d ("Close diff viewer" — diff-viewer.tsx:726-732
  shadows the base exit while the viewer is open).

## Phase 2 — the diff viewer mount (auditB #6, auditA #7/§2.12)
- store: DiffViewerLive (open/return_route/session_id/mode/phase/base/
  viewer/scroll/generation) + DiffSource (branch/committed/working/
  turn with v2 labels/descriptions) + DiffPhase (Loading/Failed/
  Unavailable/Loaded) + the DiffSink fetch seam (NoDiffSink default,
  RecordingDiffSink tests, set_diff_sink_fn closure install).
  open_diff_viewer (captures returnRoute+session, clears dialogs,
  kicks fetch, generation-guarded), close_diff_viewer (navigates
  back), switch_diff_source (sticky mode + refetch),
  diff_fetch_result (stale generations drop; committed&&!base →
  Unavailable), update_diff_viewer.
- diff_viewer_mount.rs (NEW): body states (Loading "Loading diff…",
  error ×2 copy variants needs-base vs reopen, Unavailable, Empty
  "No changes to show" — diff-viewer.tsx:846-872); the content
  y-walk (diff_content_layout mirrors the painter, drift-pinned by
  unit test); scroll crop render (patch column shifts by scroll,
  tree pane + toolbar pinned, `? help` footer re-pinned to the
  viewport bottom); diff_scroll_command / diff_jump_hunk (] and [,
  FILE_HEADER_HEIGHT offset) / diff_jump_file (n/p, single-patch
  resets scroll).
- diff_viewer.rs painter: DiffFile.image (isDiffImageFile
  \.(png|jpe?g|webp|gif)$) — header shows "Image" instead of +N/−N
  (:990-997); no-patch fallback rows (committed/deleted/generic
  copy, :1012-1024); diff_layout saturating (0-width guard).
- command_palette: `diff.open` palette row (group VCS, slash /diff);
  dispatcher arms for the full diff.* family (open/close/scroll×8/
  hunks/files/preferences/switch_source/help) over the store state;
  DialogKind::DiffSource (source select, current marker, turn only
  from a session) + DialogKind::DiffHelp (3 key groups, live binding
  displays, "unbound" placeholders).
- app: render_app mounts the viewer fullscreen while open (dialogs
  still overlay); sync_modes pushes the "diff" mode (no input mode —
  the route carries no composer); stroke_in_diff consumes every
  stroke (diff layer above base; ctrl+d = the layer's app.exit
  rebind CLOSES, base exit chords still exit — diff-viewer.tsx:726).
- run loop: LoopRequest::Diff → fetch_diff (vcs.base + vcs.diff
  context=12 / session.diff for turn) → LoopFetch::Diff →
  diff_fetch_result; HTTP sink installed via set_diff_sink_fn.
- Tests: mount walker/scroll/jump/image/goldens + the dispatcher
  open→fetch→scroll→switch→close cycle (747 oc-tui tests green).
DEFERRED: the image card's working-tree halfblock preview
(DiffViewerImage's loaded bitmap — R-07 surface, needs the file
fetch + halfblock mount); export dialogs (dialog-export-* — v2 diff
export menu); file right-click menu (no context-menu model, auditA).
